  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/200YbVrt/baner-terracotta-lattices.jpg\" alt=\"裝飾性陶土格柵\" width=\"1020\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過「裝飾性陶土格柵」模組，讓您的 Minecraft 建築煥然一新。本模組新增了陶土格柵與牆壁，為您帶來獨特且吸睛的設計選項，為您的世界增添一抹時尚風采。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8LY3yyGY/2025-03-02-18-30-22.png\" alt=\"陶土格柵\" width=\"836\" height=\"470\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HDsGBWkZ/wall.jpg\" alt=\"牆壁\" width=\"727\" height=\"510\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>合成</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9HLBwGGL/CRAFTING.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"456\" height=\"430\"><br></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
